{"id":"648392","name":"薄皮椒炒咸菜丝","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/648392/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"咸菜丝","amount":"200g"},{"name":"薄皮椒","amount":"3个"}],"sub":[{"name":"猪肉","amount":"100g"},{"name":"食用油","amount":"半匙"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"猪肉切片。","img":"images/648392/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"取薄皮辣椒。","img":"images/648392/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"洗净切丝。","img":"images/648392/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"切葱和蒜苗和姜，取干辣椒。","img":"images/648392/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"咸菜打丝浸泡至没有咸味，洗净捞出沥干水分。","img":"images/648392/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"热锅冷油，油热放花椒八角。","img":"images/648392/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放肉片。","img":"images/648392/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"把肉片炒焦黄。","img":"images/648392/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"把干辣椒捏碎放进来。","img":"images/648392/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"把干辣椒炒微糊。","img":"images/648392/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放薄皮辣椒和葱姜蒜苗。","img":"images/648392/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放咸菜翻炒。","img":"images/648392/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"翻炒的过程放生抽。","img":"images/648392/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放食盐。","img":"images/648392/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"翻炒几分钟，放蒜片炒均匀即可。","img":"images/648392/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/648392/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}